	(lib_symbols)
	(text "BLOCK: power_entry_24v\n\nSCOPE\n  24 V DC input via KPJX-4S latching circular connector (REQ-EL-04).\n  Reverse-polarity protection, inrush limiting, input fusing, TVS clamp,\n  input bulk capacitance and common-mode filtering for the 24 V rail.\n  Owns the +24V master isolation link and its current-measurement break.\n  Provides the V24_MON divider into the STM32 internal ADC (PC1/ADC1_INP11).\n\nINTERFACES - the binding contract between blocks.\nReconciled against docs/FAFF-2-Electronics-Full.svg (block diagram) and\nhardware/cubemx/ARIA_SRB_FAFF_2_POC_CBs_1.ioc (MCU pin-map authority).\nNeed something not listed here? Raise it - do not invent it.\n  IN   J-PWR : 24 V DC, 25 W peak / 7 W typical (REQ-EL-02/03)\n  OUT  +24V_SW, PGND -> power_rails, motor_drive\n  OUT  V24_MON (scaled, filtered) -> mcu PC1\n  TEST TP +24V_IN, TP +24V_SW, TP PGND; LK current break on +24V_SW\n\nSTATUS: stub. No circuitry drawn yet - this sheet is reserved for the\nfollow-up block task that owns this file. Invoke /schematic-style before\nthe first edit, and delete this note once the block is drawn."
